{
 "openapi": "3.0.3",
 "info": {
  "title": "Salesforce REST API v62.0: the answers read by frappe-idempotent-importer",
  "version": "2026-10-21",
  "description": "Writes tests/schemas/salesforce.json: the REST API answers the Salesforce adapter reads, as an OpenAPI\ndocument transcribed from Salesforce's official references (Salesforce publishes no static OpenAPI document\nfor its standard objects; its sObjects OpenAPI generator is a per-org beta):\n\n- the Query resource's answer (REST API Developer Guide, \"Execute a SOQL Query\",\n  https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/atlas.en-us.api_rest.meta/api_rest/dome_query.htm): ``totalSize``,\n  ``done``, ``nextRecordsUrl`` while not done, and ``records``, each with its ``attributes`` (``type``,\n  ``url``) and the fields the query selects; a child relationship's records nest as a query result of their\n  own (SOQL and SOSL Reference, \"Relationship Queries\");\n- the sObject Describe resource's answer (https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/atlas.en-us.api_rest.meta/\n  api_rest/resources_sobject_describe.htm, DescribeSObjectResult and Field in the SOAP API's\n  \"describeSObjects()\" reference): the object's ``name``, ``label`` and ``custom``, and each field's\n  ``name``, ``label``, ``type``, ``custom`` and ``picklistValues`` (``value``, ``label``, ``active``,\n  ``defaultValue``);\n- each object's fields as the Object Reference types them\n  (https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/atlas.en-us.object_reference.meta/object_reference/sforce_api_objects_<object>.htm):\n  a field without a value is null; custom fields (API names ending ``__c``) are the org's own, so any other\n  field of a record is a string, number, boolean or null.\n\n``python -m tools.salesforce_schema`` rewrites it."
 },
 "paths": {
  "/services/data/v62.0/query": {
   "get": {
    "responses": {
     "200": {
      "description": "OK",
      "content": {
       "application/json": {
        "schema": {
         "$ref": "#/components/schemas/QueryResult"
        }
       }
      }
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "/services/data/v62.0/query/{locator}": {
   "get": {
    "responses": {
     "200": {
      "description": "OK",
      "content": {
       "application/json": {
        "schema": {
         "$ref": "#/components/schemas/QueryResult"
        }
       }
      }
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "/services/data/v62.0/sobjects/{sObject}/describe": {
   "get": {
    "responses": {
     "200": {
      "description": "OK",
      "content": {
       "application/json": {
        "schema": {
         "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DescribeSObjectResult"
        }
       }
      }
     }
    }
   }
  }
 },
